The Mongol Hordes Scenario
Difficulty : 8
Bonus : 80
--------------------------------------------------------------
You are the ambitious leader of the small Mongol nation.  Long denigrated by your  rich and proud neighbors as a barbarian, you feel that it is time to show them just what "barbarians" are capable of.
Your horsemen, the scourge of the plains, are ready and willing to ride with you for plunder and glory.
You must bring down the proud Chinese Kingdom to the South within six years.  This will be much easier to do if you can remain on good terms with the Indian Kingdom.

